{"parentUuid":"6e5e91bc-b76a-486d-a1e5-60ec0b0d5434","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"msg_202603251338365d3704aefc534c4c","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## 可用的 Agent/Skill 列表\n\n### Unity3D 专用 Agent（写代码必须遵守）\n\n| Agent | 作用 | 触发时机 |\n|-------|------|----------|\n| **unity-code-reviewer** | 代码规范审查（只读） | 每次代码生成/修改后 |\n| **unity-code-tester** | 功能测试验证 | 审查通过后 |\n| **unity-mcp-skill** | Unity编辑器自动化 | 需要操作Unity编辑器时 |\n\n### 工作流程\n\n```\n代码生成/修改\n      ↓\n1. unity-code-reviewer (规范检查)\n      ↓\n  有问题? → 修复 → 再次审查\n      ↓ (通过)\n2. unity-code-tester (功能验证)\n      ↓\n  有失败? → 修复 → 再次测试\n      ↓ (通过)\n3. 完成 ✓\n```\n\n### 其他通用 Skills\n\n| Skill | 用途 |\n|-------|------|\n| simplify | 代码简化审查 |\n| browser-automation | Web应用测试 |\n| android-device-automation | Android设备自动化 |\n| ios-device-automation | iOS设备自动化 |\n| harmonyos-device-automation | 鸿蒙设备自动化 |\n| desktop-computer-automation | 桌面应用自动化 |\n| claude-api | Claude API开发 |\n\n---\n\n## 写代码时必须遵守的规范\n\n**规范文件**: `C:\\Users\\hufeifei.JOY\\.claude\\rule\\unity3d-code-standards.md`\n\n关键要点：\n- **界面类**必须继承 `PopupBaseView`\n- **命名**: 类名PascalCase，私有字段`_camelCase`，常量`UPPER_SNAKE_CASE`\n- **界面命名**: `***View`（如 `HeroListView`）\n- **组件命名**: `***Com`（如 `HeroIconCom`）\n\n当前打开的 [FBAllianceGiftView.cs](Assets/DevCodeFM/IF/DayZClasses/view/popup/alliance/AllianceGiftView/FBAllianceGiftView.cs) 就是遵循这个规范的界面类。"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":17752,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":15872,"output_tokens":768,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}},"type":"assistant","uuid":"7e4f6465-6ebc-4000-8c6f-d54f2125b203","timestamp":"2026-03-25T05:39:02.486Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"e:\\WorkSpace\\RedAlert_SuperFormat